        "text": "theorem cross_reconstruct_component (H : Mat2) (T R : Vec2)\n    (hcone : SmoothCovariance.StrictCone H T) (i : Fin 2) :\n    2 * (H.mulVec (fun j => SmoothCovariance.amplitudes H T j * increment H T R j)) i = R i"
